[144.942374, "o", "# Quarterly Operations Summary\r\n\r\nACME Robotics delivered 1,284 industrial units in Q3 2026, an increase of 18.6% year-over-year. Manufacturing throughput rose to 94.2% utilization, exceeding the 88% target set in March. Net revenue from the robotics segment reached $42.7M, while operating costs held steady at $28.1M, yielding a 34.2% margin. Customer satisfaction surveys returned an average score of 4.7/5 across 312 enterprise accounts in North America and Europe.\r\n\r\n# Research and Development Highlights\r\n"]
